flowchart TD
  START([Start training attempt]) --> METRIC[Record train/validation metrics]
  METRIC --> STATUS{Enough evidence?}
  STATUS -->|No| METRIC
  STATUS -->|Yes - healthy| CONT[Continue until objective or budget end]
  CONT --> FINAL[Independent holdout evaluation]
  STATUS -->|Overfit / underfit / divergence| STOP[Gracefully stop and preserve best checkpoint]
  STOP --> DIAG[Meta advisor proposes a bounded remediation]
  DIAG --> CHECK{Deterministic policy accepts?}
  CHECK -->|No| HUMAN[Escalate / halt]
  CHECK -->|Yes| BUDGET{Attempts and budget left?}
  BUDGET -->|No| HUMAN
  BUDGET -->|Yes| PATCH[Version and test training config]
  PATCH --> RESTART[New isolated training attempt]
  RESTART --> METRIC
  FINAL --> PROMO{Promotion criteria passed?}
  PROMO -->|Yes| REG[Register model with approval]
  PROMO -->|No| HUMAN
